  "licenceTitle": "Ra-Thor Commercial Licence",
  "licenceLead": "A plain summary for organization use and the commercial uses listed in LICENSE §2 when using Ra-Thor or Rathor.ai.",
  "licenceUpdated": "Last updated: 2026-10-17",
  "licenceWhoTitle": "Who needs one",
  "licenceWhoBody": "You need a Ra-Thor Commercial Licence if you are an organization using Ra-Thor or Rathor.ai, or if you sell it, a fork, a wrapper or a hosted instance, host the Software for profit, bundle it into a paid product, or run large-scale public multiplayer hosting of it for revenue or advertising, whichever AI model you run it with — for example Grok, Claude, ChatGPT, or others. Those names are examples only; no vendor is our partner, endorser, or affiliate. Use for personal, educational, research, or non-commercial creative work stays free under AG-SML v1.2 when non-revenue.",
  "licenceWhoSee": "See <a href=\"https://github.com/Eternally-Thriving-Grandmasterism/Ra-Thor/blob/main/LICENSE\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LICENSE</a> §2 for the full list.",
  "licenceFreeTitle": "When AG-SML may be enough",
  "licenceFreeIntro": "Personal use, education, research, and non-commercial creative work by a natural person can stay under the public AG-SML v1.2 grant when it fits the licence files in the monorepo and use is non-revenue. The site FAQ states:",
  "licenceFaqQuote": "The Autonomicity Games Sovereign Mercy License (AG-SML v1.2). Individuals may use the work for personal, educational, research, and non-commercial creative use. Any revenue or income from using, running, or outputs requires a paid commercial licence from Autonomicity Games Inc. Organization use and the other cases listed in LICENSE §2 require a separate paid commercial licence. License files live in the monorepo.",
  "licenceLicenseLead": "The repository LICENSE also says:",
  "licenceLicenseQuote": "The following require a <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">separate paid commercial license</strong> from Autonomicity Games Inc., written and signed (email to info@Rathor.ai):…",
  "licenceLicensorTitle": "Licensor",
  "licenceLicensorBody": "Autonomicity Games Inc.",
  "licenceAskTitle": "How to ask",
  "licenceAskBody": "Email <a href=\"mailto:info@Rathor.ai\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">info@Rathor.ai</a> with your organization (if any), intended use, and timeline. This site does not publish prices, percentages, tiers, or checkout.",
  "licenceAskForm": "You may also use the <a href=\"/contact.html#commercial-inquiry\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">commercial inquiry form</a> on the contact page.",
  "licenceAgreementTitle": "This page is not the agreement",
  "licenceAgreementBody": "The terms of each Ra-Thor Commercial Licence are set in a separate written agreement between you and Autonomicity Games Inc. This page is a summary to help you decide whether to write; it is not the licence itself and does not create a contract.",
  "licenceRepoBody": "Repository copy: <a href=\"https://github.com/Eternally-Thriving-Grandmasterism/Ra-Thor/blob/main/docs/LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">docs/LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md</a>. Longer exhibit: <a href=\"https://github.com/Eternally-Thriving-Grandmasterism/Ra-Thor/blob/main/COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md</a>.",
  "licenceClosing": "Inspectable research software. No warranty. This page makes no capability or safety claims.",
  "launchTitle": "Site map",
  "privacyClosing": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated “Last Updated” date.",
  "privacyComp1": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">GDPR</strong>",
  "privacyComp2": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">CCPA</strong>",
  "privacyComp3": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">COPPA</strong>",
  "privacyComp4": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">EU AI Act</strong>",
  "privacyComp5": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Canadian IPC-OHRC Principles</strong> / PIPEDA-aligned minimisation",
  "privacyComplianceFoot": "Because this website collects no personal data, many controller obligations are reduced in practice. That is not a certificate. See the public claims record: PUBLIC_CLAIM.lock.md.",
  "privacyComplianceLead": "Ra-Thor is designed with privacy minimisation in mind. Names below are <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">design-intent references</strong>, not ISO/IEC 42001 certification or EU AI Act conformity:",
  "privacyComplianceTitle": "Compliance",
  "privacyContactIssues": "GitHub Issues",
  "privacyContactLead": "For any privacy-related questions",
  "privacyContactMail": "info@Rathor.ai",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact",
  "privacyData1": "No cookies are used.",
  "privacyData2": "No tracking technologies or analytics are employed.",
  "privacyData3": "No personal information is requested, stored, or transmitted.",
  "privacyData4": "All computations and simulations run locally in your browser.",
  "privacyData5": "Lattice Chat stores sessions in <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">localStorage</strong> on this device only. Optional passphrase encryption uses Web Crypto (PBKDF2 + AES-GCM) in the browser. Living chat does not write IndexedDB. Nothing is uploaded to a Ra-Thor backend — we do not operate one.",
  "privacyData6": "Optional WebLLM and “Local Server” bridges stay on your machine. Connecting a local endpoint (Ollama / LM Studio) is your choice and does not send history to rathor.ai.",
  "privacyDataFoot": "The commercial-inquiry form does not upload to rathor.ai; it opens your mail app.",
  "privacyDataLead": "This website collects no personal data whatsoever.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "Data Collection",
  "privacyHow1": "When you use the connected demos (Grok or X integrations), those interactions are governed by the respective platforms’ (xAI / X Corp) privacy policies.",
  "privacyHow2": "When you use <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">the Shard demo</strong> or <a href=\"/chat.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Lattice Chat</a>, <strong class=\"text-amber-300\">the session store stays on your device</strong>. Optional encryption never leaves the browser. Bridging to Grok / X / another cloud model is explicit and then follows that provider’s policy.",
  "privacyHowTitle": "How Ra-Thor Works",
  "privacyLead": "Nothing we control leaves this device.",
  "privacyOverview1": "Ra-Thor (rathor.ai) is built so you stay in control of your data. This site and its demos collect as little as possible.",
