  "chatReplyWho": "I am the Lattice Chat surface of Ra-Thor (workspace 14.15.6) — inspectable research software. The lattice is the mercy checks. I am the optional sampler. Outputs are drafts. Responses are made in this browser unless you connect a Local Server or an online provider, which then receives your messages. No data is collected. Contact info@Rathor.ai.",
