  "chatReplyCopy": "Use **Copy Context** — it builds a clean system prompt + your full history (and any injected documents) so you can paste it into Grok, Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT, or any other model.",
  "chatReplyHelp": "You can chat offline, manage multiple sessions, search messages, upload documents into context, use Local Server (Ollama), enable WebLLM, speak with the mic, hear replies, Copy Context to any public LLM, and optionally encrypt the entire session store with a passphrase. Everything stays under your control.",
